- Kamu dapat ini!

55
00:02:33.687 --> 00:02:34.688
[kontestan 1] Jalankan!

56
00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.357
[kontestan 2] Dia cepat.

57
00:02:37.424 --> 00:02:38.725
[kontestan 3] Dia mendapat pukulan cepat.

58
00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.099
[kontestan 4] Dia cepat.

59
