Oh, tolong jangan.

153
00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:32.419
- [Lee] Oke, kita hentikan di sini.
- [bel berbunyi]

154
00:07:32.485 --> 00:07:34.254
- [Lee] Permainan yang bagus.
- Wow!

155
00:07:34.321 --> 00:07:36.189
[penyiar] <i>Pertarungan telah usai.</i>

156
00:07:36.256 --> 00:07:37.657
Itu luar biasa!

157
