172
00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:23.203
Sellchan punya kekuatan. Dia baik.

173
00:08:23.937 --> 00:08:25.505
[kontestan 6]
Dari Tim Tinju Nasional Remaja.

174
00:08:26.673 --> 00:08:28.008
{\an8}Hai, saya Yang Sellchan,

175
00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:30.677
{\an8}mantan petinju Tim Nasional Muda,
