[Lee] Putaran kedua <i>I Am Boxer</i> adalah...

1041
00:46:47.305 --> 00:46:50.441
Perlombaan Pukulan Enam lawan Enam.

1042
00:46:51.108 --> 00:46:52.510
- Baiklah!
- Oke!

1043
00:46:52.576 --> 00:46:53.611
Ayo!

1044
00:46:59.950 --> 00:47:02.219
[penyiar]
<i>Dalam Balapan Pukulan Enam lawan Enam...</i>

1045
00:47:06.290 --> 00:47:09.460
<i>dua tim beranggotakan enam orang akan berhadapan.</i>

1046
00:47:12.029 --> 00:47:15.766
